{{quotation|game|Trade to the [[Shining Blade]] for other items or double-click to use: Gain +5 [[Armor rating|armor]] and +1 [[health regeneration]] for 30 minutes.}}

== Acquisition ==
* 3-30 are rewarded for [[Wanted by the Shining Blade|Shining Blade Bounties]].
* One can be obtained for every three [[Confessor's Orders]] given to a [[Confessor's Orders#Collectors|collector]].
* Two or three are rewarded for guiding [[Courier Falken]] through an area in [[normal mode]]. Five or six are rewarded for guiding him through an area in [[Hard mode]].
* Five are rewarded for repeating [[Auspicious Beginnings]], [[A Vengeance of Blades]], [[Shadows in the Jungle]], or [[Rise]].

