== Notes ==

* The in-game description of this item is colored white, unlike other consumables, which usually use a gray text.
* Invaluable when used in [[Remains of Sahlahja]] ([[The Desolation]]) [[challenge mission]] to offset the effects of [[health degeneration]], allowing the [[Junundu]]'s natural regeneration to take over.
* [[Bowl of Skalefin Soup]] offers the same health regeneration for 30 minutes, without the [[Sweet Tooth|sweet points]] or armor benefits.

